    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "maybe it's not trauma though. maybe it's just who i am. i see people doing good things and i just don't get the impulse. i'm just a parasite, really. taking up oxygen, eating food, living a life that doesn't belong to someone who actually has a soul. it feels like i'm just waiting for the universe to realize its mistake and correct itself. like, why am i even still here if i'm just a void?",
